    "author_association": "OWNER",
    "body": "The inactive full camp was caused by one bad activation gate: the code required both the finished lit campfire and a transient player_camp script reference on the same frame. Your prior live sessions prove that reference stays at zero after the physical camp exists, so activation could never commit. The source now treats the exact finished P_CAMPFIRE02X_COMBO in the requested footprint as the postcondition; the script-reference count is diagnostic only. A successful activation will set the CSV row active, refresh the named Active marker, save it, and use a real Rockstar feed toast. This is source-complete but not built or installed; Lexer-Lux/Lexeditor#101 remains actionable and high priority.",
